# Monster death loot (authoring)

Follow **`docs/MONSTER_DEATH_LOOT.md`** and **ADR-0009** in **`docs/ARCHITECTURE_DECISIONS.md`**.

- **Embedded** under `MonsterResource.DeathLoot` — **only** for **trash / vendor fodder** with **no** crafting, alchemy, quests, or other shared systems.
- **Standalone** `Content/Item/…` **.tres** + **`ItemDatabase`** — when the item has **any** non-trash role now or you expect it later (alchemy, recipes, shared drops, NPCs).

When promoting an item from trash → multi-use: move it out of the monster record into a standalone item and reference it from death loot.
